{"id":"semana","lemma":"semana","pos":"noun","rank":238,"glosses":["week (7 days)"],"ipa":"/seˈmana/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"semanas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-semana.wav","formAudio":{"semanas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-semanas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cómo estuvo tu semana?","en":"How was your week?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443681","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Te veré en tres semanas.","en":"See you in three weeks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459138","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Nos conocimos la semana pasada.","en":"We met last week.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/119085","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"transit, crossing"}]},{"text":"No te he visto en semanas.","en":"I haven't seen you in weeks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582447","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"seen"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"¡Qué semana más larga!","en":"What a long week!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636991","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"long","l":"largo"}]}]}